{"id":"GHSA-8r8v-xf7q-rcpr","axis":"advisories","repo":"QuantumNous/new-api","sha":"c9943d37ad93477dd937fc4901cc3c4e0fd8aaab","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"AGENTS.md","lines":["@@ -100,9 +100,10 @@ Do NOT directly import or call `encoding/json` in business code. `json.RawMessag"," "," **Billing safety invariants:** Quota/billing code MUST never produce a negative charge (a credit) from arithmetic overflow or unvalidated input. Apply defense in depth:"," ","-- Every user-controlled quantity that becomes a billing multiplier (image `n`, video `seconds`/`duration`, resolution/quality ratios, batch counts) MUST be bounded before it reaches quota calculation. Reject out-of-range values at request validation with a 400. Existing bounds: `dto.MaxImageN` for image generation count, `relaycommon.MaxTaskDurationSeconds` for task video duration. Reuse these constants instead of introducing new ad hoc limits for the same concepts.","+- Every user-controlled quantity that becomes a billing multiplier (image `n`, video `seconds`/`duration`, resolution/quality ratios, batch counts) MUST be bounded before it reaches quota calculation. Reject out-of-range values at request validation with a 400. Existing bounds: `dto.MaxImageN` for image generation count, `relaycommon.MaxTaskDurationSeconds` for task video duration, `maxTokensLimit` (`relay/helper/valid_request.go`) for `max_tokens`-family fields on every relay format (OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, Responses). Reuse these constants instead of introducing new ad hoc limits for the same concepts. When adding a new relay format or request DTO, bound its max-tokens and count fields in its validator from day one."," - Watch for validation bypass paths: passthrough fields (e.g. `Extra[\"parameters\"]`), task `metadata` maps, and multipart form fields can carry the same quantities around the standard DTO validation. Any adaptor that reads a multiplier from such a path must enforce the same bound (or clamp) locally.","-- Never convert a computed quota to `int` with a bare cast like `int(float64(quota) * ratio)` or `int(decimal.IntPart())`. Use the saturating converters: `common.QuotaFromFloat` for float products, `decimalToQuota` in `service` for decimal products. Saturation bounds are int32 because quota columns (user/token/log) are 32-bit integers in the database.","+- Durations parsed from media metadata are user/upstream-controlled too: audio file headers (transcription token counting, TTS response duration) and upstream deduction numbers (e.g. Kling `FinalUnitDeduction`) can claim absurd values. Convert them with saturation before they become token counts.","+- Never convert a computed quota or token count to `int` with a bare cast like `int(float64(quota) * ratio)`, `int(math.Round(...))` on unbounded input, or `int(decimal.IntPart())`. Use the saturating converters: `common.QuotaFromFloat` for float products, `decimalToQuota` in `service` for decimal products, `billingexpr.QuotaRound` (saturating) for tiered-expression results. Saturation bounds are int32 because quota columns (user/token/log) are 32-bit integers in the database."," - Multiplier maps go through `types.PriceData.AddOtherRatio`, which rejects non-positive, NaN, and +Inf ratios. Do not write to `PriceData.OtherRatios` directly, and do not weaken these guards."," - Pre-consume (预扣费) and settle (结算/差额) must both be safe: a saturated oversized quota must fail pre-consume with insufficient-quota, never silently wrap. When adding a new billing path (new relay format, new task platform, new adjustment hook), trace the full chain — validation → EstimateBilling/OtherRatios → quota conversion → pre-consume → settle/refund — and confirm each step preserves these invariants."," - Fields parsed into unsigned types (`*uint`) accept huge positive JSON numbers (e.g. `18446744073686646784`, a wrapped negative); a `>= 0` check is not sufficient, an upper bound is mandatory."],"additions":3,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"pkg/billingexpr/billingexpr_test.go","lines":["@@ -291,6 +291,12 @@ func TestQuotaRound(t *testing.T) {"," \t\t{999.4999, 999},"," \t\t{999.5, 1000},"," \t\t{1e9 + 0.5, 1e9 + 1},","+\t\t// Oversized expression results must saturate at int32 bounds","+\t\t// instead of wrapping into a negative charge.","+\t\t{3.6893488147419103e19, math.MaxInt32},","+\t\t{-3.6893488147419103e19, math.MinInt32},","+\t\t{math.Inf(1), math.MaxInt32},","+\t\t{math.NaN(), 0},"," \t}"," \tfor _, tt := range tests {"," \t\tgot := billingexpr.QuotaRound(tt.in)"],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pkg/billingexpr/round.go","lines":["@@ -5,6 +5,20 @@ import \"math\""," // QuotaRound converts a float64 quota value to int using half-away-from-zero"," // rounding. Every tiered billing path (pre-consume, settlement, breakdown"," // validation, log fields) MUST use this function to avoid +-1 discrepancies.","+//","+// The result saturates at int32 bounds: quota columns are 32-bit integers in","+// the database, and an oversized expression result must never wrap around","+// and turn a charge into a credit."," func QuotaRound(f float64) int {","-\treturn int(math.Round(f))","+\tr := math.Round(f)","+\tif math.IsNaN(r) {","+\t\treturn 0","+\t}","+\tif r >= math.MaxInt32 {","+\t\treturn math.MaxInt32","+\t}","+\tif r <= math.MinInt32 {","+\t\treturn math.MinInt32","+\t}","+\treturn int(r)"," }"],"additions":15,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"relay/channel/openai/audio.go","lines":["@@ -103,8 +103,9 @@ func OpenaiTTSHandler(c *gin.Context, resp *http.Response, info *relaycommon.Rel"," \t\t\tusage.CompletionTokens = estimatedTokens"," \t\t\tusage.CompletionTokenDetails.AudioTokens = estimatedTokens"," \t\t} else if duration > 0 {","-\t\t\t// 计算 token: ceil(duration) / 60.0 * 1000，即每分钟 1000 tokens","-\t\t\tcompletionTokens := int(math.Round(math.Ceil(duration) / 60.0 * 1000))","+\t\t\t// 计算 token: ceil(duration) / 60.0 * 1000，即每分钟 1000 tokens。","+\t\t\t// duration 解析自上游返回的音频元数据，饱和转换防止 int 回绕。","+\t\t\tcompletionTokens := common.QuotaFromFloat(math.Round(math.Ceil(duration) / 60.0 * 1000))"," \t\t\tusage.CompletionTokens = completionTokens"," \t\t\tusage.CompletionTokenDetails.AudioTokens = completionTokens"," \t\t}"],"additions":3,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"relay/channel/task/kling/adaptor.go","lines":["@@ -358,7 +358,8 @@ func (a *TaskAdaptor) ParseTaskResult(respBody []byte) (*relaycommon.TaskInfo, e"," \t\t\ttaskInfo.Url = video.Url"," \t\t}"," \t\tif tokens, err := strconv.ParseFloat(resPayload.Data.FinalUnitDeduction, 64); err == nil {","-\t\t\trounded := int(math.Ceil(tokens))","+\t\t\t// 上游返回的扣费数值，饱和转换防止超大数值回绕成负数","+\t\t\trounded := common.QuotaFromFloat(math.Ceil(tokens))"," \t\t\tif rounded > 0 {"," \t\t\t\ttaskInfo.CompletionTokens = rounded"," \t\t\t\ttaskInfo.TotalTokens = rounded"],"additions":2,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"relay/helper/max_tokens_bounds_test.go","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,72 @@","+package helper","+","+import (","+\t\"bytes\"","+\t\"net/http\"","+\t\"net/http/httptest\"","+\t\"testing\"","+","+\trelayconstant \"github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/relay/constant\"","+\t\"github.com/gin-gonic/gin\"","+\t\"github.com/stretchr/testify/require\"","+)","+","+// TestMaxTokensBounds guards the billing invariant that user-supplied max","+// token fields are bounded on every relay format. These values feed","+// pre-consume quota math (preConsumedTokens * ratio); a huge or","+// wrapped-negative value (e.g. 18446744073686646784 parsed into *uint) must","+// be rejected at validation instead of corrupting the pre-charge.","+func TestMaxTokensBounds(t *testing.T) {","+\tgin.SetMode(gin.TestMode)","+","+\tnewJSONContext := func(t *testing.T, body string) *gin.Context {","+\t\tc, _ := gin.CreateTestContext(httptest.NewRecorder())","+\t\tc.Request = httptest.NewRequest(http.MethodPost, \"/relay\", bytes.NewBufferString(body))","+\t\tc.Request.Header.Set(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")","+\t\treturn c","+\t}","+","+\tconst hugeN = \"18446744073686646784\"","+","+\tt.Run(\"openai max_tokens overflow rejected\", func(t *testing.T) {","+\t\tc := newJSONContext(t, `{\"model\":\"gpt-4o\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"hi\"}],\"max_tokens\":`+hugeN+`}`)","+\t\t_, err := GetAndValidateTextRequest(c, relayconstant.RelayModeChatCompletions)","+\t\trequire.Error(t, err)","+\t\trequire.Contains(t, err.Error(), \"max_tokens is invalid\")","+\t})","+","+\tt.Run(\"openai max_completion_tokens overflow rejected\", func(t *testing.T) {","+\t\tc := newJSONContext(t, `{\"model\":\"gpt-4o\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"hi\"}],\"max_completion_tokens\":`+hugeN+`}`)","+\t\t_, err := GetAndValidateTextRequest(c, relayconstant.RelayModeChatCompletions)","+\t\trequire.Error(t, err)","+\t\trequire.Contains(t, err.Error(), \"max_tokens is invalid\")","+\t})","+","+\tt.Run(\"claude max_tokens overflow rejected\", func(t *testing.T) {","+\t\tc := newJSONContext(t, `{\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-4\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"hi\"}],\"max_tokens\":`+hugeN+`}`)","+\t\t_, err := GetAndValidateClaudeRequest(c)","+\t\trequire.Error(t, err)","+\t\trequire.Contains(t, err.Error(), \"max_tokens is invalid\")","+\t})","+","+\tt.Run(\"claude normal max_tokens accepted\", func(t *testing.T) {","+\t\tc := newJSONContext(t, `{\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-4\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"hi\"}],\"max_tokens\":8192}`)","+\t\treq, err := GetAndValidateClaudeRequest(c)","+\t\trequire.NoError(t, err)","+\t\trequire.EqualValues(t, 8192, *req.MaxTokens)","+\t})","+","+\tt.Run(\"gemini maxOutputTokens overflow rejected\", func(t *testing.T) {","+\t\tc := newJSONContext(t, `{\"contents\":[{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"hi\"}]}],\"generationConfig\":{\"maxOutputTokens\":`+hugeN+`}}`)","+\t\t_, err := GetAndValidateGeminiRequest(c)","+\t\trequire.Error(t, err)","+\t\trequire.Contains(t, err.Error(), \"maxOutputTokens is invalid\")","+\t})","+","+\tt.Run(\"responses max_output_tokens overflow rejected\", func(t *testing.T) {","+\t\tc := newJSONContext(t, `{\"model\":\"gpt-4o\",\"input\":\"hi\",\"max_output_tokens\":`+hugeN+`}`)","+\t\t_, err := GetAndValidateResponsesRequest(c)","+\t\trequire.Error(t, err)","+\t\trequire.Contains(t, err.Error(), \"max_output_tokens is invalid\")","+\t})","+}"],"additions":72,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"relay/helper/price.go","lines":["@@ -112,12 +112,12 @@ func ModelPriceHelper(c *gin.Context, info *relaycommon.RelayInfo, promptTokens"," \t\taudioRatio = ratio_setting.GetAudioRatio(info.OriginModelName)"," \t\taudioCompletionRatio = ratio_setting.GetAudioCompletionRatio(info.OriginModelName)"," \t\tratio := modelRatio * groupRatioInfo.GroupRatio","-\t\tpreConsumedQuota = int(float64(preConsumedTokens) * ratio)","+\t\tpreConsumedQuota = common.QuotaFromFloat(float64(preConsumedTokens) * ratio)"," \t} else {"," \t\tif meta.ImagePriceRatio != 0 {"," \t\t\tmodelPrice = modelPrice * meta.ImagePriceRatio"," \t\t}","-\t\tpreConsumedQuota = int(modelPrice * common.QuotaPerUnit * groupRatioInfo.GroupRatio)","+\t\tpreConsumedQuota = common.QuotaFromFloat(modelPrice * common.QuotaPerUnit * groupRatioInfo.GroupRatio)"," \t}"," "," \t// check if free model pre-consume is disabled","@@ -194,7 +194,7 @@ func ModelPriceHelperPerCall(c *gin.Context, info *relaycommon.RelayInfo) (types"," \tfreeModel := false"," "," \tif usePrice {","-\t\tquota = int(modelPrice * common.QuotaPerUnit * groupRatioInfo.GroupRatio)","+\t\tquota = common.QuotaFromFloat(modelPrice * common.QuotaPerUnit * groupRatioInfo.GroupRatio)"," \t\tif !operation_setting.GetQuotaSetting().EnableFreeModelPreConsume {"," \t\t\tif groupRatioInfo.GroupRatio == 0 || modelPrice == 0 {"," \t\t\t\tquota = 0","@@ -203,7 +203,7 @@ func ModelPriceHelperPerCall(c *gin.Context, info *relaycommon.RelayInfo) (types"," \t\t}"," \t} else {"," \t\t// 按量计费：以模型倍率的一半作为预扣额度","-\t\tquota = int(modelRatio / 2 * common.QuotaPerUnit * groupRatioInfo.GroupRatio)","+